---
import '../../styles/admin-workspace.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
  <meta name="referrer" content="same-origin" />
  <title>GetFlexSpace Admin</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg?v=logo-x" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="admin-workspace">
    <header class="workspace-header">
      <a class="workspace-brand" href="/admin/" aria-label="GetFlexSpace Admin"><img src="/images/brand/getflexspace-color.svg" alt="GetFlexSpace" width="1243" height="228"/><span>Admin</span></a>
      <nav class="workspace-tabs" aria-label="Admin sections">
        <button type="button" id="content-tab" aria-current="page" aria-controls="content-panel">Content</button>
        <button type="button" id="tours-tab" aria-controls="tours-panel">Tour requests</button>
        <button type="button" id="accounts-tab" aria-controls="accounts-panel" hidden>Accounts</button>
      </nav>
      <a class="workspace-site" href="/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View site ↗</a>
      <button type="button" id="workspace-signout" class="workspace-signout" hidden>Sign out</button>
    </header>
    <p id="workspace-notice" class="workspace-notice" role="status" hidden></p>
    <main class="workspace-main">
      <section id="login-panel" class="workspace-panel account-panel" aria-labelledby="login-heading" hidden>
        <div class="admin-login-card">
          <p class="account-eyebrow">YOUR GETFLEXSPACE WORKSPACE</p>
          <h1 id="login-heading">Welcome back.</h1>
          <p>Sign in to manage website content, tour requests, and the waitlist.</p>
          <form id="account-login-form">
            <label>Username<input id="login-username" name="username" autocomplete="username" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" required maxlength="64" /></label>
            <label>Password<input id="login-password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="256" /></label>
            <button type="submit" class="account-primary">Sign in</button>
          </form>
          <p id="login-message" role="status"></p>
          <p class="account-help">Need access or a password reset? Contact the account owner.</p>
          <a href="/admin/?login=github" class="owner-signin">Owner sign-in with GitHub →</a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section id="content-panel" aria-label="Website content" class="workspace-panel" hidden>
        <p id="cms-loading" class="workspace-loading" role="status">Loading content manager…</p>
        <div id="nc-root"></div>
      </section>
      <section id="tours-panel" aria-label="Tour requests" class="workspace-panel" hidden>
        <iframe id="tours-frame" title="Tour requests inbox" referrerpolicy="same-origin"></iframe>
      </section>
      <section id="accounts-panel" aria-labelledby="accounts-heading" class="workspace-panel account-panel" hidden>
        <div class="account-container">
          <p class="account-eyebrow">CONTROL WHO HAS ACCESS</p>
          <h1 id="accounts-heading">Accounts.</h1>
          <p>Create a separate login for each person or AI. Editors can publish website content and manage all tour and waitlist requests.</p>
          <div id="connection-notice" class="connection-notice" hidden>
            <strong>Finish connecting content editing</strong>
            <p>Add a fine-grained GitHub token as the <code>CMS_GITHUB_TOKEN</code> encrypted secret in Cloudflare Pages. Limit it to the GetFlexSpace repository, with Contents read/write. Keep this credential in Cloudflare; give each AI its own login below.</p>
          </div>
          <form id="create-account-form" class="create-account-form">
            <label>Name<input name="name" required maxlength="80" placeholder="Grok" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label>Username<input name="username" required pattern="[a-zA-Z0-9][a-zA-Z0-9._-]{1,63}" maxlength="64" placeholder="grok" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" /></label>
            <label>Access<select name="role"><option value="editor">Editor — content + inbox</option><option value="owner">Owner — also manage accounts</option></select></label>
            <button class="account-primary" type="submit">Create account</button>
          </form>
          <p class="account-help">A strong password is generated for you. Only owners can create accounts, reset passwords, or disable access.</p>
          <div id="new-credentials" class="new-credentials" hidden>
            <strong>Save this password now. It is shown only once.</strong>
            <p>Share these details only with the person or AI receiving access. This login can view personal information in the leasing inbox.</p>
            <label>Login details<textarea id="credential-details" readonly rows="4" spellcheck="false"></textarea></label>
            <button type="button" id="copy-credentials">Copy login details</button>
            <button type="button" id="dismiss-credentials">I saved it</button>
          </div>
          <p id="accounts-message" role="status"></p>
          <div id="accounts-list" class="accounts-list"></div>
          <details class="account-activity"><summary>Recent account activity</summary><ul id="account-activity-list"></ul></details>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
  <noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to sign in and manage your website and tour requests.</p></noscript>
  <script src="../../scripts/admin-workspace.ts"></script>
</body>
</html>
